<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Galatsenji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatsenji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola Cãtrã Galatsenji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola Cãtrã Galatsenji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Pavlu, apostul pitricut nu di la oaminji, nitsi di la un om, ma prit Isus Hristos sh-prit Dumnidzãlu Tatãl, cai lu nyie dit mortsã, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />deadun cu tuts fratslji shi surãrili cai suntu cu mini cãtrã biseritsli di Galatia:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Har sh-pace pristi voi di la Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a nostru sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />tsi s-curbãnsi trã amãrtiili a noastri, tra s-nã ascapã di aestã etã arauã dupã vrearea a Dumnidzãlui sh-a Tatãlui a nostru. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />A lui s-lji hibã mãrirea, tu eta a etilor! Amin!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Mi ciudisescu cãt trãoarã ma vã dipãrtats di Dumnidzãlu, tsi vã acljimã tu harul a Hristolui, sh-ma vã turnats tu un altu evanghelu. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Altu evanghelu nu easti, ma suntu niscãntsã oaminji cai vã tulburã sh-vor si strãmbã evanghelu a Hristolui. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ma, sh-ca s-hibã cã vãrã di noi icã vãrã anghil dit tser vã preadicã un altu evanghelu di atsel tsi vã avem predicat, atsel s-hibã blãstimat! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ashã cum vã am dzãsã, tora vã dzãc nãpoi: Macã vãrã vã preadicã un altu evanghelu di atsel tsi voi avets aprucheat, atsel s-hibã blãstimat! <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nacã mini ma caftu s-ljeau arsirea a oaminjlor, icã a Dumnidzãlui? Ama caftu s-lj-arsescu a oaminjlor? Macã mini ma caftu s-lj arsescu a oaminjlor, nu va s-earam huzmichearu al Hristos.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mini voi tsi sã shtits, frats shi surãri, cã evanghelu tsi vã am dimãndat nu yini di la oaminjlji. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Nu u loai sh-nu u nvitsai di vãrã om, ma prit discupirirea di la Isus Hristos. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Cã voi avets avdzãtã trã bana a mea di ma nãinti tu Iudaismu, cu cãt zel lu priaĝuneam mini bisearica a Dumnidzãlui sh-vream s-u aspãrdzeam. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mini ma nãintam tu Iudaismu ma multu di vãrstnitslji a farãljei a mea sh-earam multu datã dupã adetsili a pãrintsãlor a melji. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ma a Dumnidzãlui, cai mi aleapsi di tu pãnticlu a mumãljei a mea sh-mi acljimã prit harul a lui, lj-arsi <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />s-discoapirã Hiljilu a lui tu mini, tra s-pot s-lu dimãndu la pãngãnjlji. Trã atsea mini nu mi urnipsii cu vãrã altu. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Mini nu mi alinai nsus tu Ierusalem tra s-mi adunam cu atselji cai eara apostulji nãintea a mea, ma mi dush tu Arabii. Ma nãpoi mi turnai tu Damascu. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Atumtsea dupã trei anji, mi dush nsus tu Ierusalem tra s-mi adunam cu Chefa sh-armash cu nãsu tsintsisprãdzatsi di dzãli. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Mini nu vidzui vãrã di apostulji, di cãt mash Iacovul, fratili al Domnu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Mini vã siguripsescu voi nãintea a Dumnidzãlui cã aesti tsi scriu nu suntu arãdeari. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Deapoea mi dush tu locurili a Siriiljei sh-a Chilichiiljei. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Mini earam nicunuscut di biseritsli tu Iudea, cai suntu tu Hristos. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Elji avea avdzãtã mash cã: “Atsel tsi ma nãinti nã priaĝunea noi, tora dimãndã pistea tsi unãoarã vrea s-u-aspãrdzea.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Elji multumãrea Dumnidzãlu trã itia a mea.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Aprucheat di Apostulji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Deapoea dupã patrusprãdzatsi di anji mi alinai iarã tu Ierusalem cu Barnaba, luãnda cu mini sh-Titu. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mi dush aclo dupã unã discupiriri sh-ti adunari singur cu oaminjlji avdzãts lã sitãxii a lor evanghelu tsi ma dimãndu cãtrã pãngãnjlji, tsi mini s-nu alãgam shi s-nu alagã di vãnat. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ma nitsi Titul, cai eara cu mini, cu tutã cã eara elin nu prindea tra s-anvãrliga-tãljea, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />cã niscãntsã frats arãdioshi avea intratã cu nãeti trã ciuliri libertatea a noastrã tsi avem tu Hristolu Isus, tra s-nã sclãvueascã. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Noi nu nã sumbãgãm aishtor vãrãoarã, tsi alihea a evanghelui s-armãnã niminatã la voi.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Atselji tsi s-tsãnea cu autoritati, (sh-trã aestã nu mi miliseashti cã tsi eara cã Dumnidzãlu nu giudicã oaminjlji dupã pãrearea di nafoarã), atselji cai eara cu ma mari autoritati nu nji adãvgarã tsiva a predicariljei a mea. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Di contra, elji avea vidzutã cã evanghelu trã atselji cai nu eara anvãrliga-tãljeats nj-eara pistipsit a njia, sh-atselji anvãrliga-tãljeats a Petrului. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Dumnidzãlu tsi avea faptã Petrul apostul trã anvãrliga-tãljeatslji, mi featsi sh-mini apostul trã pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Iacovul, Chefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chefa pi uvreieshti easti numa Petru. </char></note> sh-Ioanul, tsi s-cunushtea ca coloani, nji strimsirã mãna a njia sh-al Barnaba ca semnu di uspitsãlji, cunuscãnda harul tsi nã eara datã, tsi noi s-njidzeam cãtrã pãngãnjlji sh-elji cãtrã anvãrliga-tãljeatslji. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Tuts nã cãftarã tra s-nã adutseam aminti di niavutslji a lor, ashãtsi cum aveam sh-mini tu minti s-fãtseam.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Vãrgheashti Chefa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ma, cãndu vini Chefa tu Antiochia mini lu ncuntrai n-fatsã, cã eara ti ncuntrari. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Nãinti tsi s-yinea niscãntsã oaminji dit partea al Iacov, Chefa mãca deadun cu pistimenjlji pãngãnji. Iarã cãndu vinirã elji, s-trapsi nãpoi shi s-dispãrtsã di pãngãnjlji, cã s-aspãrã di anvãrliga-tãljeatslji. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Sh-alantsã Iudei s-prifãtsea deadun cu nãsu, ahãntu multu cãtã sh-Barnaba s-trapsi nãpoi di ipucrizia a lor. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Cãndu vidzui cã elji nu bãna ndreptu dupã alihea a evanghelui, lji dzãsh al Chefa nãintea a tutulor: “Macã tini tsi eshti Iudeu bãnedz ca pãngãnjlji sh-nu ca Iudeilji, cãtse lji anãngãseshti pãngãnjlji s-bãneadzã ca Iudei?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Noi him Iudei nãscuts sh-nu amãrtioshi dit pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Noi shtim cã omlu nu si ndripteadzã di faptili a legiljei, ma mash prit pistea tu Isus Hristos. Trã atsea sh-pistipsim tu Hristolu Isus, tra s-nã fãtsem ndreptsã prit pistea tu Hristos sh-nu prit faptili a legiljei, cã vãrã om nu va si ndripteadzã prit faptili a legiljei. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Macã noi cãftãm s-nã fãtsem ndreptsã prit Hristolu, nã aflãm sh-noi amãrtioshi, nacã sh-Hristolu lji huzmitipseashti a amãrtiiljei? Pute s-nu hibã! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Macã va s-adram nãpoi atseali lucri tsi surpai, mini dealihea mi fac cãlcãtor a legiljei. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ashãtsi, prit legea escu mortu trã legea, tra s-bãnedz trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Mini mi crutsisii cu Hristolu sh-tora nu bãnedz mini, ma Hristolu bãneadzi tu mini. Sh-bana tsi u fac tu aestu trup, u bãnedz prit pisti tu Hiljilu al Dumnidzãlu tsi mi vru shi muri ti mini. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mini nu lu aruc hima harul a Dumnidzãlui, cã macã ndriptatea yini prit lege, atumtsea Hristolu muri di vãnat!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Ndriptatea prit Pisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Voi glari Galatsenji! Cai vã zurli a voauã? Nãintea a ocljilor a voastri Isus Hristolu si zugrãfsi crutsisit. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Mash aestã voi s-aduchescu di la voi: Lu loat Duhlu prit faptili a legiljei, icã prit pistipsirea tsi avdzãt? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Voi hits ahãt zurlji? Dupã tsi apãrnjit tu Duh, tora vrets s-bitisits prit faptili a truplui? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Nacã traptã arãu di vãnat? Nãdãescu s-nu hibã di vãnat. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Vã ntreb nãpoi, Dumnidzãlu vã da a voauã Duhlu a lui sh-fatsi lucri thãvmãsiti namisa di voi prit faptili a legiljei, icã prit pistea tu evanghelu tsi ascultat? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ashãtsi sh-Abrahamul lji pistipsi a Dumnidzãlui sh-aestã lji si-lugursi ca ndriptati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ahr 15:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Aduchits atumtsea, cã atselji tsi au pisti, suntu cilimenjlji al Abraham. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Scritura prividzu cã Dumnidzãlu va lji ndripteadzã pãngãnjlji prit pistea, sh-lji hãbãrsi ma nãinti al Abraham evanghelu: “Tuti fãrili va hibã ghinicuvãntati prit tini.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Ahr 12:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ashãtsi atselji tsi pistipsescu suntu ghinicuvintats deadun cu Abrahamul, omlu a pistiljei. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Tuts atselji cai s-andoapirã tu faptili a legiljei suntu sum blãstem, cum easti scriat: “Blãstimat s-hibã atsel tsi nu fatsi itsido tsi easti scriat tu Cartea a Legiljei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Deut 27:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Easti limpid cã vãrã nu s-fatsi ndreptu prit legea nãintea al Dumnidzãu, cã “ndreptul va s-bãneadzã prit pisti.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Legea nu easti dit pistea, ma: “atsel tsi li featsi, va s-bãneadzã prit nãsi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Hristolu nã arãscumpãrã dit blãstemlu a legiljei, cã elu idyiul s-featsi blãstem trã noi, cum easti scriat: “Blãstimat easti caitsido tsi si spindzurã pri un lemnu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Deut 21:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Elu nã arãscumpãrã noi cu nãeti tsi ghinicuvintarea al Abraham s-yinã la pãngãnjlji prit Hristolu Isus, tsi prit pistea noi s-putem s-lom tãxirea a Duhlui.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Legea sh-Tãxirea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Frats shi surãri, vã zburãscu ca om. Vãrã nu poati s-lji mutã icã s-lji avdagã tsiva a unei pisti-ligãturã umineascã dupã tsi aestã s-hibã vulusitã. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Tãxirili suntu aspusi al Abraham sh-a simintsãljei a lui. Scritura nu dzãtsi “sh-a simintsãlor”, tsi va s-dzãc multsã oaminji, ma “a simintsãljei a ta”, tsi va s-dzãc un om, tsi easti Hristolu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Tora mini ma dzãc aestã: Legea tsi vini patru suti treidzãtsi di anji ma nãpoi, nu lu nãpãrteadzi pisti-ligãtura vulusit di ma nãinti di la Dumnidzãlu shi s-li aleapid tãxirili a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Ex 12:40</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Macã mushtinirea yini dit legea, atumtsea nu va yinea di tãxirea, ma Dumnidzãlu tu harul a lui lj-u-deadi atsea al Abraham prit tãxirea. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Cãtse si deadi legea atumtsea? Legea si deadi s-aspunea tsi eara cãlcãrili a legiljei, pãnã cãndu s-yinea siminãtura a cui lj-si eara faptã tãxirea. Legea s-dimãndã prit anghilji sh-lji si pistipsi a unui anamisãtor. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Un anamisãtor nu easti mash di unã parti, iarã Dumnidzãlu easti un. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Atumtsea easti legea contra a tãxirilor? Pute s-nu hibã. Cã, macã va eara datã unã lege tsi poati s-da banã, atumtsea dealihea ndriptatea va yinea di la legea. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ma Scritura dzãtsi cã itsido lji easti sumbãgat a amãrtiiljei, ashãtsi sh-tãxirea s-da prit pistea tu Isus Hristos atsilor cai pistipsescu. <verse eid="GAL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Nãinti tsi s-yinea pistea, noi nã tsãneam hãpsãnits sum putearea a legiljei, ashtiptãnda pistea tsi va s-discupirea. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ashãtsi legea s-featsi vigljitorlu a nostru pãnã tu vinita a Hristolui, tra s-nã ndriptam prit pistea. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Tora tsi pistea ari vinitã, noi nu him ma sum un vigljitor. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Cã tu Hristolu Isus tuts voi hits hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui prit pistea. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Tuts tsi vã pãtidzat tu Hristolu, hits nviscuts cu Hristolu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Nu ari ma Iudeu icã Elin, nu ari ma sclav icã liber, nu ari ma mascur icã theamin, cã tuts voi hits fapts un tu Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Macã voi hits a Hristolui, atumtsea voi hits siminãtura al Abraham sh-mushtinitori dupã tãxirea.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Voi s-dzãc cã di cãt chiro tsi un mushtinitor easti nicriscut, elu nu s-aleadzi di un sclav, cu tut cã easti nicuchirlu a tutã aveariljei. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Mushtinitorlu easti sum vigljitorlu sh-administratorlu pãnã tu chirolu tsi easi arãdãpsit di la tatã-su. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ashãtsi sh-noi, cãndu earam nicriscuts, noi fum sumbãgats a fuchiilor sufliteascã dit lumi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ma cãndu chirolu arãdãpsit vini, Dumnidzãlu pitricu Hiljilu a lui, amintat di unã muljeari sh-nãscut sum lege, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />trã arãscumpãrari atselji tsi eara sum lege, tsi noi s-puteam s-nã fãtseam hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Cã voi hits hiljilji a lui, Dumnidzãlu pitricu Duhlu al Hiljilui a lui tu ininjli a noastri, Duhlu tsi acljeami: “Abba, Tatã!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ashãtsi cã voi nu hits ma sclayi, ma hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui, sh-metsi voi hits hiljilji a lui, Dumnidzãlu vã ari faptã sh-mushtinitori.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ma nãinti, cãndu voi nu lu cunushteat Dumnidzãlu, voi earat sclayi atsilor tsi dealihea nu suntu dumnidzadz. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ma tora tsi voi lu cunushtets Dumnidzãlu icã ma ghini s-dzãtsem, hits cunuscuts di la Dumnidzãlu, cum di vã turnat la fuchiili slabi sh-urfãnami sh-vrets s-vã sclãvuits nãpoi di atselji? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Voi sãrbãtorits niscãnti dzãli, meshi, sezoni sh-anji. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Am fricã cã mi munduii di vãnat trã voi. <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Vã fac rigeai, frats shi surãri, s-vã fãtsets ca mini, tsi sh-mini s-mi fac ca voi. Voi nu nj-avets faptã vãrã arãu.<verse eid="GAL 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Cum shtits, fu trã itia a unei lãngoari tsi mini di prota oarã vã dimãndai evanghelu a voauã. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Cu tutã cã lãngoarea a mea eara munduiri trã voi, voi nu mi atinjisit sh-nu mi arnisit. Ma aljumtrea, voi mi aprucheat ca un anghil a Dumnidzãlui, canda s-eara idyiul Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Atumtsea, iu easti ghinicuvintarea a voastrã trã mini? Mini mãrtirsescu cã ma si eara putut voi va scuteat ocljilji a voshtri shi s-nji li dãdeat a njia. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Tora mi feciu mini dushmanlu a vostru cã vã dzãsh alihea? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Atselji oaminji si spunã cu zel tra s-vã amintã a voauã, ma trã scupadz arãi. Atselji vor s-vã dipãrteadzã di noi shi s-njidzets dupã nãshi cu zel. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Easti ghini s-hits totãna cu zel trã ghineatsa, ma nu mash cãndu mini escu cu voi. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Cilimenjlji a melji vruts, tsi mini escu tu dureari di amintari pãnã cãndu Hristolu s-hibã adrat tu voi! <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Cãt va s-vream s-earam ningã voi tora shi s-alãxeam boatsea a mea, cã nu shtiu tsi s-fac cu voi!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sara sh-Hagar, Alegoria a Doauã a Pisti-ligãturiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Dzãtsets-nji, voi tsi vrets s-hits sum lege, nu aduchitsã tsi dzãtsi legea? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Cã easti scriatã Abrahamul avea doi hilji: un di muljeari sclavã sh-un di muljeari liberã. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Hiljilu a muljeariljei sclavã s-amintã dupã trup, ma hiljilu a muljeariljei liberã s-amintã prit tãxirea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Aesti lucri suntu spusi ca unã alegorii. Doauli muljeri suntu ca doauã pisti-ligãturi. Unã di atseali pisti-ligãturi dit Muntili Sinai tsi amintã cilimenji a sclãyiiljei, easti Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hagar tsi va s-dzãc Muntili Sinai tu Arabii, undzeashti cu Ierusalemlu di azã, cã ea easti tu sclãyii cu cilimenjlji a ljei. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Iarã muljearea liberã pãrãstiseashti Ierusalemlu di nsus cai easti muma a noastrã. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Cã easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 4:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Hãrsea-ti muljeari stearpã, tini tsi nu amintsã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">aurlã di harauã sh-grea cu boatsi analtã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">tini tsi nu avush durearili a amintariljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">cã ma multsã suntu hiljilji a muljeariljei apãrãtsitã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">di cãt atsiljei tsi ari bãrbat.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Tora voi, frats shi surãri, ashã ca Isacul, hits cilimenji a tãxiriljei. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Atumtsea hiljilu amintat dit trup priaĝunea hiljilu amintat prit putearea a Duhlui. Sh-azã ashã undzeashti. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ma tsi dzãtsi Scritura? “Aĝunea muljearea sclavã cu hiljilu a ljei, cã hiljilu a sclavãljei nu poati s-hibã mushtinitor deadun cu hiljilu a muljeariljei liberã.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9-10">Ahr 21:9-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Trã atsea, frats sh-surãri, noi nu him cilimenjlji a sclavãljei, ma cilimenjlji a muljeariljei liberã.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Libertatea tu Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Hristolu nã liberã tra s-him liberi. Stats vãrtoshi shi s-nu vã sumbãgats nãpoi sum giuglu a sclãyiiljei. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ia! Mini Pavlu ma vã dzãc, cã macã vã anvãrliga-tãljeats, Hristolu nu va s-vã axizeascã dip. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Mini voi s-lji dimãnda a cuitsido tsi s-anvãrliga-talji si shtibã cã elu easti strimtu si mplineascã tutã legea. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Voi tsi cãftats s-vã ndriptats prit legea hits dispãrtsãt di Hristolu sh-avets cãdzut dit harul. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Cã tu Duh prit pistea noi ashtiptãm cu nãdii s-nã ndriptãm. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Cã tu Hristolu Isus nu axizeashti nitsi anvãrliga-tãljearea sh-nitsi nianvãrliga-tãljearea, ma axizeashti mash pistea cai lucreadzã prit vrearea.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Voi avets alãgat ghini. Cai vã nchidicã tra s-nu vã cãndãrsits a alihiljei? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Aestã cãndãrsiri nu yini di atsel tsi vã acljeamã. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Putsãn mãeauã lipseashti tra s-yinã tut aloatlu. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mini escu pistimen tu Domnul cã voi nu va s-minduits altã soi. Ma atsel tsi vã tulburã, caitsido s-hibã va s-ljea condamna a lui. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Macã mini, frats shi surãri, dimãndu ninga anvãrliga-tãljearea, cãtse escu tora priaĝunit? Atumtsea crutsea a Hristolui nu va eara ma ncheadic. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Va s-vream si sãcãtipseascã atselji tsi vã tulburã. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Voi, frats sh-surãri, hits acljimats s-hits liberi. Ma nu u ufilisits aestã libertati tra si-mplinits orixili a truplui, ma ma ghini s-lji-huzmitipsits a un alantui cu vreari. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Cã tutã legea easti priadunatã tu aestã dimãndari: “S-vrei aproapilu ca bana a ta.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Macã voi mãshcats sh-mãcats un alantu, afirits-vã tra s-nu vã afãnisits di un-alantu.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Faptili a Truplui sh-Frutili a Duhlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Trã atsea vã dzãc: imnats tu Duh, sh-ashãtsi nu va s-mplinits orixili a truplui. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Cã orixili a truplui suntu contra a Duhlui, sh-Duhlu easti contra a orixilor a truplui. Elji ncuntreadzã un alantu sh-ashãtsi voi nu putets s-fãtsets atsea tsi vrets. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Macã voi vã cãlãuzits di Duhlu, nu hits sum legea. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Faptili a truplui suntu vidzuti: putãnsirea, lãvushiturã, disfrãnarea, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />idulatria, mãyiia, dushmãnilji, ngrãnji, nchizmã, nãriri, ambitsili egoisti, dispãrtsãrili, ereziili, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />zilii, mbitãrili, chehili disfrãnati sh-alti ca aesti. Mini vã prihãbãrsescu, cum vã am dzãs sh-ma nãinti, cã atselji tsi fac ahtãri lucri nu va s-mushtineadzã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ma frutlu a Duhlui easti, vrearea, haraua, pacea, arãvdarea, imireatsa, bunã-vrearea, pistimeniljea, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />frunimeatsa sh-contsãnearea. Contra atsilor nu ari lege. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Atselji tsi suntu tu Hristolu Isus lu au crutsisit truplu cu pasiunili sh-orixili a lui. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Macã bãnãm tu Duh, prindi s-imnãm dupã Duhlu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />S-nu nã alãvdãm cu cãrteari shi s-nu him nchizmataric cu un alantu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Urnipsirili di Soni sh-Salutãrili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Frats sh-surãri, macã videts vãrã om tu amãrtii, voi tsi bãnats tu Duh prindi s-lu ndriptats atsel om cu frunimeatsã. Ma afirits-vã tra s-nu cãdets sh-voi tu cãrteari. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Tsãnets sartsinili a unui-alantu, sh-ashãtsi voi mplinits legea a Hristolui. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Macã vãrã mindueashti cã easti tsiniva, cãndu nu easti tsiva, elu idyiul s-arãdi. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Cathiunu sã sitãxeascã faptili a lui sh-deapoea idyiul elu si s-alãvdã shi s-nu s-undzeascã cu vãrã altu. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Cã caitsido prindi s-poartã sartsina a lui. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Cai ljea nvitsãtura a zborlui, prindi mpartsã cu nvitsãtorlu a lui tuti bunili.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Nu vã arãdets: Dumnidzãlu nu s-pizueashti. Un om seatsirã atsea tsi ari siminatã. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Caitsido tsi seaminã tra s-lji arseascã a truplui a lui, va seatsirã aspãrdzeari di truplu a lui. Caitsido tsi seaminã di Duh, va seatsirã di Duhlu bana eternã. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />S-nu nã curmãm trã fãtseari ghini, cã tu chirolu tsi prindi noi va s-adunãm sitsirari macã nu nã curmãm. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Trã atsea, cãt s-putem s-fãtsem ghini a tutulor, ma multu a oaminjlor pistimenji.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Videts cu tsi gramati mãri vã scriai a voauã cu mãna a mea. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Atselji tsi vor si s-veadã ghini tu trup, atselji vã stringu s-vã anvãrliga-tãljeats, mash tra s-nu si priaĝuneascã tra itia a crutsiljei a Hristolui Isus. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Nitsi atselji cai suntu anvãrliga-tãljeats nu u tsãnã legea, cu tutã atsea elji vor tsi voi s-vã anvãrliga-tãljeats, tra si s-alavdã cu anvãrliga-tãljearea a voastrã tu trup. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Di partea a mea, nu voi pute s-mi alavdu, di cãt mash cu crutsea a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, prit cai lumea easti crutsisitã trã mini, sh-mini trã lumea. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Nu axizescu nitsi anvãrliga-tãljearea sh-nitsi nianvãrliga-tãljearea, ma axizeashti fãptura atsea noaua. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Pace sh-njilã trã voi tuts tsi urmats aestu ordin sh-trã Israelul al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Di tora sh-nclo vãrã s-nu mi cãrteascã, cã mini portu seamnili al Isus tu truplu a meu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Harul a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos s-hibã cu duhlu a vostru, frats sh-surãri. Amin.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>